### request_builder

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"type request_builder_switch =\n    {\n        Gleam : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Lua : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Fsharp : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Python : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        TypeScript : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Cpp : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        CppHost : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Delphi : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Cuda : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        C : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'\n        Rust : $'reqwest_wasm::RequestBuilder'\n    }\nnominal request_builder =\n    `(\n        fsharp_global \"type reqwest_RequestBuilder = class end\"\n        $'' : $'backend_switch `(request_builder_switch)'\n    )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  type request_builder_switch =
      {
          Gleam : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Lua : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Fsharp : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Python : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          TypeScript : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Cpp : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          CppHost : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Delphi : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Cuda : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          C : $'reqwest_RequestBuilder'
          Rust : $'reqwest_wasm::RequestBuilder'
      }
  nominal request_builder =
      `(
          fsharp_global "type reqwest_RequestBuilder = class end"
          $'' : $'backend_switch `(request_builder_switch)'
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

