### tcp_client

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"nominal tcp_client =\n    `(\n        backend_switch `(()) `({}) {\n            Fsharp = (fun () =>\n                global \"type System_Net_Sockets_TcpClient = System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\\n\"\n                        ) : () -> ()\n        }\n        $'' : $'System_Net_Sockets_TcpClient'\n    )","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  nominal tcp_client =
      `(
          backend_switch `(()) `({}) {
              Fsharp = (fun () =>
                  global "type System_Net_Sockets_TcpClient = System.Net.Sockets.TcpClient\n"
                          ) : () -> ()
          }
          $'' : $'System_Net_Sockets_TcpClient'
      )
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

### new_tcp_client

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl new_tcp_client () : tcp_client =\n    run_target function\n        | Fsharp => fun () => $'new `tcp_client ()'\n        | _ => fun () => null ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
