### client_connect_async

<!-- livebook:{"chunks":null,"kind":"Elixir.Spiral.Kino.SmartCell","attrs":{"timeout":300,"source":"inl client_connect_async\n    (host : string)\n    (port : i32)\n    (ct : threading.cancellation_token)\n    (client : tcp_client)\n    : async.value_task\n    =\n    run_target function\n        | Fsharp => fun () => $'!client.ConnectAsync (!host, !port, !ct)'\n        | _ => fun () => null ()","print_code":false},"livebook_object":"smart_cell"} -->

```elixir
Spiral.Kino.eval!(
  ~S"""
  inl client_connect_async
      (host : string)
      (port : i32)
      (ct : threading.cancellation_token)
      (client : tcp_client)
      : async.value_task
      =
      run_target function
          | Fsharp => fun () => $'!client.ConnectAsync (!host, !port, !ct)'
          | _ => fun () => null ()
  """,
  timeout: 300_000
)
```

